                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d2325a5-718b-3cf9-9308-b072f52a4e94",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8a1296-4814-388d-9a7b-4153bd2bddf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A flat-bottomed craft able to float and drift on water, used for transport or as a waterborne platform."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "346f92c7-c2dc-49c2-9a95-72d5ceb05e80",
                                                "sense_id": "5d2325a5-718b-3cf9-9308-b072f52a4e94",
                                                "text": "They floated down the river on an inflatable raft"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c9c221d-6f65-31d6-ad94-eb8e52f0ebc4",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8a1296-4814-388d-9a7b-4153bd2bddf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any flattish thing, usually wooden, used in a similar fashion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee4e7cfb-684d-47a9-9d69-6145c503e16f",
                                                "sense_id": "7c9c221d-6f65-31d6-ad94-eb8e52f0ebc4",
                                                "text": "When George Stephenson built the Liverpool & Manchester Railway he encountered the same difficulty at Chat Moss and solved the problem by constructing a kind of raft made of brushwood that more or less floated on the surface of the bog. On this he placed as much firm soil as his raft could carry, when the operation was repeated, the first raft being thereby sunk with its load of solid earth, which was not displaced."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05565924-8e3f-4090-84de-a018762436ed",
                                                "sense_id": "7c9c221d-6f65-31d6-ad94-eb8e52f0ebc4",
                                                "text": "Even though in a way you let him freeze to death in the water, because the way I see it...\nI agree. Y'know, I think he actually could have fitted on that bit of door.\nThere was plenty of room on the raft.\nI know. I know, I know."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82ee4662-f707-3ec5-9f32-befc656000cf",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8a1296-4814-388d-9a7b-4153bd2bddf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thick crowd of seabirds or sea mammals, particularly a group of penguins when in the water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f2a4d6c-9e39-4042-8fb2-e238782ee959",
                                                "sense_id": "82ee4662-f707-3ec5-9f32-befc656000cf",
                                                "text": "Pelicans, bills stuck forward, would gather in small rafts to move along in comical formation, before diving in unison […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cc2466e-786f-319f-a201-d86ef580697e",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8a1296-4814-388d-9a7b-4153bd2bddf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A collection of logs, fallen trees, etc. which obstructs navigation in a river."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42503458-f9b4-3aa0-a1d6-bb455c75ce0b",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8a1296-4814-388d-9a7b-4153bd2bddf6",
